[32m╭─ Claude ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│[39m The Diwali 2026 launch kit is ready. The fact-checker found one unsupported claim and fixed it.  [32m│
│[39m The files are in `launch-kit/`.                                                                  [32m│
│[39m                                                                                                  [32m│
│[39m **Research (`research.md`)**                                                                     [32m│
│[39m - **Diwali 2025:** The 14–21 October window brought 131 orders and Rs. 162,785 in sales. Scaled  [32m│
│[39m to a 7-day week, that is about 125% more revenue than a normal week.                             [32m│
│[39m - **Hampers:** The Festive hamper was the top product in that window, with 28 orders and 39% of  [32m│
│[39m sales.                                                                                           [32m│
│[39m - **Eggless:** About 35% of cake orders are eggless. The existing hamper has the lowest eggless  [32m│
│[39m share, at 29%.                                                                                   [32m│
│[39m - **OMR:** It is the fastest-growing area, but 25 of 33 OMR survey respondents said the Rs. 180  [32m│
│[39m delivery charge makes them give up on ordering.                                                  [32m│
│[39m - **Caveats:** The data covers only one Diwali, and the survey is small. The researcher also     [32m│
│[39m assumed the sales amounts exclude delivery charges, which the data doesn't confirm.              [32m│
│[39m                                                                                                  [32m│
│[39m **Pricing (`pricing.md`)** — every hamper clears the 40% minimum margin.                         [32m│
│[39m                                                                                                  [32m│
│[39m | Hamper | Price | Margin |                                                                      [32m│
│[39m |---|---|---|                                                                                    [32m│
│[39m | Deepam (small) | Rs. 749 | 43.3% |                                                             [32m│
│[39m | Jyothi (medium) | Rs. 1,349 | 41.8% |                                                          [32m│
│[39m | Jyothi Eggless (medium) | Rs. 1,349 | 40.3% |                                                  [32m│
│[39m                                                                                                  [32m│
│[39m **Copy (`posts.md`)** has three Instagram captions and a WhatsApp broadcast. One caption is in   [32m│
│[39m Tamil and features the eggless hamper.                                                           [32m│
│[39m                                                                                                  [32m│
│[39m **Fact-check (`factcheck.md`)**                                                                  [32m│
│[39m - **Prices and contents:** They match the source files.                                          [32m│
│[39m - **Fixed claim:** "Each packed by hand" had no source, so it now reads "each packed with a gift [32m│
│[39m box".                                                                                            [32m│
│[39m - **"Top seller" claim:** It holds for Diwali week only. Over the full year the hamper ranks 6th [32m│
│[39m by revenue.                                                                                      [32m│
│[39m                                                                                                  [32m│
│[39m **Before posting**                                                                               [32m│
│[39m - Have a native Tamil speaker read the Tamil caption.                                            [32m│
│[39m - Add the Diwali 2026 date, an order link or phone number, and a fix for the OMR delivery        [32m│
│[39m charge. The posts have none of these because the files didn't include them. They currently say   [32m│
│[39m "message us" or "reply to this message".                                                         [32m│
